    "why_not_body_edit": "The github-api MCP server exposes NO issue-update tool. Its full tool set is add_comment, auto_commit_and_pr, close_issue, create_issue, create_issue_branch, create_label, create_milestone, create_pr, full_merge_cycle, get_pr_status, label_issue, list_issues, merge_pr, validate_build. There is no update_issue, no get_issue and no list_comments. Issue bodies therefore still name blockers by local draft key; the comment on each issue is the cross-reference of record.",
